      "description": "“Light Between Moments” is more than just a generative art project – it is a deeply personal and intimate glimpse into the artist’s inner world. Life is made up of both highs and lows - in fact, the highs would lose their meaning without the lows. What truly matters is our ability to endure the difficult times and savor the joyful ones. The vivid geometries within the artworks symbolize the light that emerges between the often dark and monotonous phases of life. These forms are usually structured and precisely arranged, yet at times they break into chaos – wild and unrestrained. And still, it is these fleeting moments of brightness that make life worth living.",
